{"id":"bestens","lemma":"bestens","pos":"adv","rank":1636,"glosses":["very well, perfectly","cordially"],"ipa":"/ˈbɛstn̩s/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/71/De-bestens.ogg/De-bestens.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Es funktioniert bestens.","en":"It works great.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/166324","words":[{"g":"it"},{"g":"to work, function","l":"funktionieren"},null]},{"text":"Alles ist bestens.","en":"Everything is fine.","words":[{"g":"everything"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null]},{"text":"Mach dir keine Gedanken. Alles ist bestens.","en":"Don't worry. Everything's OK.","words":[{"g":"to make","l":"machen"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"du"},{"g":"no / not a","l":"kein"},{"g":"a thought [with an…","l":"Gedanke"},{"g":"everything"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null]},{"text":"Ich habe mich bestens amüsiert.","en":"I had a fantastic time.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/756070","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"me","l":"ich"},null,{"g":"to be amused","l":"amüsieren"}]},{"text":"Du wirst dich bestens amüsieren!","en":"You're going to have so much fun.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"you","l":"du"},null,{"g":"to be amused"}]}]}